        <rdfs:seeAlso rdf:resource="http://w3id.org/nfdi4ing/metadata4ing#HostingInstitution"/>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">The organisation allowing the resource to be available on the internet through the provision of its hardware/software/operating support.</skos:definition>
        <skos:editorialNote>Kind of Source: Quotation. Source of definition: http://w3id.org/nfdi4ing/metadata4ing#HostingInstitution https://datacite-metadata-schema.readthedocs.io/en/4.6</skos:editorialNote>
