        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">software developer role</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A person primarily responsible for programming, software development, designing computer programs, implementation of the computer code and supporting algorithms, and testing of existing code components.</skos:definition>
